# ============================================================================
# Personal exploratory fine-tuning track. Code, small OOD test batteries, and
# small report JSONs ARE tracked (see personal_finetune/README.md) -- only the
# large regenerable artifacts are excluded here: full training/eval data
# (already hosted on the farahelmashad/personal-pii-tamerbert-generalization-data
# Kaggle dataset and regenerable via personal_finetune/augmentation/) and the
# large cached raw-prediction dumps from each trial run.
# ============================================================================
personal_finetune/**/__pycache__/
personal_finetune/tamerbert_data/*.jsonl
personal_finetune/*/outputs/**/raw_predictions.json
new_data/
TamerBERT.zip
# TamerBERT/ intentionally NOT ignored (2026-08-18): the English track needs
# train.jsonl (template recovery source), pii_table.py (Dutch reference
# generator), and org_data/*.pdf (the 5 real reference documents) directly
# from the repo rather than only via the separate Kaggle-hosted copy.

# French track (personal_finetune/french/): same rule as the Dutch track --
# code, recovered/translated templates, and OOD batteries are tracked;
# only the bulk generated train/eval data is excluded (fully regenerable
# from pii_table_fr.py + the translated templates + augment_fr.py).
personal_finetune/french/tamerbert_data_fr/*.jsonl
personal_finetune/french/train_fr.jsonl
personal_finetune/french/train_augmented_fr.jsonl
personal_finetune/french/*.csv

